---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Foster" description="Become a Lucky Penny Kitties foster and give an animal a second chance at life.">
  <section class="page-intro">
    <h1>Become a Foster</h1>
  </section>

  <section class="section" style="max-width:720px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;">
    <p>
      <strong>When you become a Lucky Penny Kitties foster, you're doing so much more than opening
      your home—you're giving an animal a second chance at life.</strong> Whether you're caring for
      a tiny bottle baby, a frightened stray, a recovering medical case, or a senior cat searching
      for comfort, your kindness provides the love, safety, and stability they need to heal. Every
      foster home becomes the bridge between rescue and a forever family. Because of compassionate
      people like you, countless animals experience hope, healing, and the opportunity to begin
      again. Together, we're not just saving lives—we're building a more compassionate community,
      one animal at a time.
    </p>

    <h2>How to Become a Foster</h2>
    <p>
      Getting started is easy! Simply complete our <strong>Foster Application</strong>, and a
      member of our all-volunteer team will review it and reach out as soon as we can. Since we're
      100% volunteer-run with no paid staff or phone line, response times can vary, but we do our
      best to get back to every applicant as quickly as possible — thank you for your patience.
    </p>
    <p>
      As part of our approval process, <strong>all foster applicants are required to complete a
      home inspection</strong> before a cat or kitten is placed in their care. This helps us ensure
      every animal is entering a safe, secure, and loving environment where they can thrive.
    </p>
    <p>
      Once approved, we'll work with you to find a foster cat or kitten that best matches your
      home, experience, and comfort level. Whether you can foster for a few weeks or several
      months, every foster home makes a life-saving difference.
    </p>
    <p>
      <strong>By opening your home, you're opening the door to hope, healing, and a brighter
      future for an animal in need. Thank you for becoming part of the Lucky Penny Kitties
      family.</strong> ❤️🐾
    </p>

    <div class="button-row">
      <a href="https://forms.gle/t5GYpRueezfhwivv6" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="cta">Apply to Foster</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
